the-firm-as-one-program-18 : List Word
the-firm-as-one-program-18 = unlines (cons "- **P7** One evaluator realizes everything, through C (hyperactivity v31 §9)." (cons "  Compiling one evaluator, under its stated adequacy and simulation premises, gives every represented program a native realization, including the checker, the specializer and the compiler themselves. Direct compilation of each construct becomes an optimization of that universal route. The chosen route runs through C and an existing compiler, and lifting that compiler into the language turns trust in it into proof (hyperactivity v31 §9)." nil))
